ernatively, maybe they can form a Pure Straight. \\n\\nBut it's unclear. \\n\\nIn terms of safety, F4 is the best option. So the answer would be to discard F4.\\n\", \"output\": \"Evaluation: [Discarding F4 is the safest option as it is an honor tile with high remaining count and less likely to aid others in forming melds.]\\nReason: [F4 has 4 remaining tiles, making it less critical for others to complete their hands. Other tiles like B7 or B9 could help form Chows if opponents have adjacent tiles. Discarding F4 minimizes the risk of giving others a winning opportunity.]\\nAnswer: Play F4\"}"}
